      "description": "Specify the extended trust infrastructure requirements surfaced by SC-16–SC-25: (1) cross-VTC credential recognition and dependency map data model; (2) constitution versioning and governance version binding in ceremony profiles; (3) adjudication interaction pattern — independent authority, procedural sequence, binding ruling artefact; (4) agent subscription/liveness pattern — push and pull notification, harm window bounding, suspension record; (5) behavioural commitment building block — data model, signing, breach record; (6) non-human entity manifest extensions for IoT/sensor/legal-personhood DIDs; (7) trust task pre-condition enforcement at PEP layer with standard violation artefact; (8) endorsement interaction pattern — accumulation, retraction semantics, graph topology credential; (9) VTC dissolution protocol — portability package, dissolution record, historical legitimacy binding; (10) governance configuration interface — version discovery endpoint, ceremony-time version binding, version mismatch failure artefact.",
